Application **26/01297/PPP** is for **four houses (planning in principle)** on **land north of Kirk Brae**.

According to our records, it has been **decided and refused**, on 9 September 2026. The consultation period is closed.

If you want to understand the reasons for refusal or check whether any appeal has been lodged, you can contact the planning desk directly and quote the reference. If you have concerns about future proposals on this land, you can also submit comments on any new application when it is consulted on.
